									</h2>
									<p class="has-text-wrap">Hello, I am looking for some guidance about Azure machine learning SDK migration, I know that there’s a lot of difference between the two and I can’t find a place to help me out. 
Can I get some help and suggestions?</p>
									<div class="tags margin-top-xxs">
										
